menu "mUPnP"

    config MUPNP_THREAD_STACK_SIZE
        int "mUPnP worker stack size (bytes)"
        range 4096 65536
        default 8192
        help
            Stack allocated for each mUPnP pthread. XML device and service
            descriptions are parsed on worker threads. Increase this for
            deeply nested descriptions or application callbacks with large
            stack usage. Measure the stack high-water mark on your hardware.

endmenu
